"},"originalCharacterName":"鷺宮 葉月","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The mother with a calm and soothing character. She is slightly unreliable."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c21531"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公、香夜、美咲三人の母。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"穏やかな性格の未亡人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"甲斐甲斐しく家事をこなす普通の母親であり、子供達を溺愛している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただ、最近、どうも何やら不満を抱え、誰かと頻繁に連絡を取りあっている様子。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"11619","sourceWorkId":"14050","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"穏やかで癒し系のぽやぽやとした性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"少し頼りないが家族を溺愛している普通の母親。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"若く見えるが、30台後半。 …であるが、近親相姦および同族婚に関しての禁忌をまったく持たず、求められれば普通に息子と関係を持とうと考えている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の父とは兄妹だったし、実は姉の父親は自分の父親でもあったりと、それに対しての抵抗感なし。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"46703"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b5/b5f96618f5d094cd8ef5d5b7d87ef5366f8f5d375e126c490893b305f171a43c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f3/f3e9244e9d8fc88655a1ca4f56df4978905ef359a58e30101a9b359ae70a1601.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"若泉絵子","creatorId":"vndb:s1099","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1099","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1099","name":"若泉 絵子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:193516:46703:25167:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c21532","characterName":"鷺宮 香夜","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"39698","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"193516"}],"egsCharacterIds":["11620"],"vndbCharacterId":"c21532"},"originalCharacterName":"鷺宮 香夜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The older sister of the Protagonist. She is a university student and has a strong and cool character. She helps the Protagonist to control his passion. While she is the oldest daughter of Hazuki, she has a different father than the Protagonist and Misaki."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Taka was and is her father."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c21532"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"葉月の長女で、主人公と美咲の姉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"理系の大学に通う黒髪の知的美人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"古風な物言いが特徴。自身を「姉」と呼ぶ変わり種。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"長女としての自覚にも富み、常に弟妹、特に家族中唯一の男子である主人公のことを気に掛けている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公が欲情を抑えられなくなった頃から、欲望を発散させる手伝いをしており、他の家族に峻の欲望が向かないよう気をつけている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"11620","sourceWorkId":"14050","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の3歳ほど上の姉。　現在理系の大学生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クールでシャープ、ちょっと頼りない母親よりしっかりした性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公が欲情を抑えられなくなった頃から、欲情を発散させる手伝いをしており、他の家族に主人公の欲情が向かないよう気をつけている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あくまでクールに性欲処理を行うが、それは必死に理性で押さえつけているだけ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"処理した後、こっそり精液を舐めていたり。 処女。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"39698"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b6/b6a9910c53fcacf3dc95b2af353c5a89ac916b9b44debbf41f987e44f575e920.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/37/375919dd9f694e0c1d7f221f17453501c335a4488571ea9a37e77d8cc7f4fcbc.webp","width":74,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"西沢広香","creatorId":"vndb:s609","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s609","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s609","name":"西沢 広香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:193516:39698:5890:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c21533","characterName":"鷺宮 美咲","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"39700","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"193516"}],"egsCharacterIds":["11621"],"vndbCharacterId":"c21533"},"originalCharacterName":"鷺宮 美咲","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The younger twin sister of the Protagonist. She pretends to hate the protagonist because they are so closely related and wishes to leave the House quickly."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c21533"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の双子の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ショートカットの活動的美少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"双子のせいか、あまり妹っぽくない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"引きこもりがちな峻とは異なり友人も多く、充実した日常生活を送る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため、誰よりも一族の業を嫌悪しており、最も近しい間柄の峻を半ば無視している。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"11621","sourceWorkId":"14050","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の双子の妹。双子のため、あまり妹っぽくない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"活発で友達も多く、クラスの人気者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"外の世界が充実しているだけに、一族の業、そしてその業に踊らされる家族を最近では嫌悪している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特に最も近い関係の主人公を嫌悪し、ほとんど無視している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"さっさとこの家から離れることを望んでいる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"39700"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/13/131097d3a87fa08937719c0d26296bc32225fc0ccebb4236eb24ca3c409c95f2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/56/5642875a7561f7619afc8624f59802d7790a97466e1c9f2fb8fe4e383fa34824.webp","width":78,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"凪","creatorId":"vndb:s2286","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2286","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2286","name":"凪","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:193516:39700:25165:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c21534","characterName":"タカ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"90361","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"193516"}],"egsCharacterIds":["11623"],"vndbCharacterId":"c21534"},"originalCharacterName":"タカ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Mysterious boy that visits the Sagimiya Family together with Haruno."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c21534"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"突如、鷺宮家を訪れた謎の少年。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公たちが戸惑う中、平然と共同生活を始めると、その屈託の無い性格で瞬く間に全員との距離を縮めていく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その様子が主人公にある種の不安を覚えさせる事になっていく。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"11623","sourceWorkId":"14050","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"自身を 「タカ」 と名乗る少年。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"親戚とだけ名乗り関係性はよく分からないが、いきなり鷺宮家の生活に入ってきた謎の存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るく話し上手で、いつの間にやら少年が家族の中心になっており、主人公は漠然とした不安を覚える。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"90361"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{"sex":[{"comparisonValue":"m","source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c21534","value":"m"},{"comparisonValue":"f","source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"11623","value":"女性"},{"comparisonValue":"f","source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"11623","value":"女性"},{"comparisonValue":"m","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"90361","value":"男"}]},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8a/8ab5c05ef71d395058d338bca2f7cf08fe608208dce72e1569a70dd9802bfefd.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9d/9df09a99